---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { frontmatter as SITE } from "../data/home.md";
---

<Layout title={"About — " + SITE.name} description="About n0qword">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="page-desc">
    <span class="count">01</span> &nbsp;who runs this blog
  </p>
  <p>
    I'm <strong>Adrian Medero</strong>, also known as <strong>n0qword</strong> — a security
    researcher and red teamer focused on Windows and Active Directory internals, C2
    infrastructure, security product evasion, and attack path management (APM).
  </p>
  <p>
    I got my start writing exploits and doing reversing, so I come from a solid low-level
    foundation that I still lean on every day. Over time I moved into red teaming, and now
    most of my time goes into researching new adversary simulation techniques and
    internals. I've always been curious about how systems work underneath, and my goal is
    simple: take things that seem harmless and figure out how to make them offensive.
  </p>
  <p>
    I use AI daily in my workflow and see real potential in it as an offensive capability.
    Beyond that, it clears out the tedious parts of the job so I can spend more time on the
    research itself, which is where I want my time going.
  </p>
  <p>
    When I'm not researching, I'm probably in a lab or a CTF, or building something. Find
    me on the links below.
  </p>
  <h2>contact</h2>
  <div class="social-links">
    <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
    <span class="social-sep">/</span>
    <a href={SITE.twitter} target="_blank" rel="noopener">twitter</a>
    <span class="social-sep">/</span>
    <a href={SITE.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin</a>
    <span class="social-sep">/</span>
    <a href={"mailto:" + SITE.mail}>mail</a>
  </div>
</Layout>